on\" content=\"Researching antifeminism, conspiracy theories and the far right. PhD from UEA, former postdoc on Everything is Connected project. UK correspondent for QAA Podcast + MAN CLAN and writer of Vaccine: The Human Story. New series TRULY TRADLY DEEPLY out now!\">\n    <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Researching antifeminism, conspiracy theories and the far right. PhD from UEA, former postdoc on Everything is Connected project. UK correspondent for QAA Podcast + MAN CLAN and writer of Vaccine: The Human Story. New series TRULY TRADLY DEEPLY out now!\">\n    \n    <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary\">\n    \n  \n  <script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"ProfilePage\",\"dateCreated\":\"2024-11-06T13:53:36.281Z\",\"mainEntity\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Annie Kelly\",\"alternateName\":\"@annieknk.bsky.social\",\"identifier\":\"did:plc:nqarhgmietntwhstejsi2lvl\",\"description\":\"Researching antifeminism, conspiracy theories and the far right. PhD from UEA, former postdoc on Everything is Connected project. UK correspondent for QAA Podcast + MAN CLAN and writer of Vaccine: The Human Story. New series TRULY TRADLY DEEPLY out now!\",\"image\":\"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:nqarhgmietntwhstejsi2lvl/bafkreif5fchjvtjhz66kcvdenk3tc26torsbbpyyj6ojo5ar5usenyevt4\",\"interactionStatistic\":[{\"@type\":\"InteractionCounter\",\"interactionType\":\"https://schema.org/FollowAction\",\"userInteractionCount\":16275}],\"agentInteractionStatistic\":[{\"@type\":\"InteractionCounter\",\"interactionType\":\"https://schema.org/FollowAction\",\"userInteractionCount\":550},{\"@type\":\"InteractionCounter\",\"interactionType\":\"https://schema.org/WriteAction\",\"userInteractionCount\":1512}]},\"hasPart\":[{\"@type\":\"DiscussionForumPosting\",\"url\":\"https://bsky.app/profile/annieknk.bsky.social/post/3ms3tuuc7ek2p\",\"identifier\":\"at://did:plc:nqarhgmietntwhstejsi2lvl/app.bsky.feed.post/3ms3tuuc7ek2p\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Annie Kelly\",\"alternateName\":\"@annieknk.bsky.social\",\"identifier\":\"did:plc:nqarhgmietntwhstejsi2lvl\",\"url\":\"https://bsky.app/profile/annieknk.bsky.social\"},\"text\":\"My toddler has a book of the ocean but whenever I identify an orca he sternly goes \\\"no. Killer whale.\\\" Is he anti-woke??\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-08-02T11:09:47.265Z\",\"interactionStatistic\":[{\"@type\":\"InteractionCounter\",\"interactionType\":\"https://schema.org/LikeAction\",\"userInteractionCount\":84},{\"@type\":\"InteractionCounter\",\"interactionType\":\"https://schema.org/CommentAction\",\"userInteractionCount\":4},{\"@type\":\"InteractionCounter\",\"interactionType\":\"https://schema.org/ShareAction\",\"userInteractionCount\":3}],\"commentCount\":4},{\"@type\":\"DiscussionForumPosting\",\"url\":\"https://bsky.app/profile/annieknk.bsky.social/post/3mrwjdpnkx22s\",\"identifier\":\"at://did:plc:nqarhgmietntwhstejsi2lvl/app.bsky.feed.post/3mrwjdpnkx22s\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Annie Kelly\",\"alternateName\":\"@annieknk.bsky.social\",\"identifier\":\"did:plc:nqarhgmietntwhstejsi2lvl\",\"url\":\"https://bsky.app/profile/annieknk.bsky.social\"},\"text\":\"I think the weirdest part of this when it was happening was how many of them were saying stuff like \\\"finally, women are getting a taste of what it's like to be judged about an aspect of their bodies they can't control!\\\" Just living on a completely different plane of reality\\n\\n[contains quote post or other embedded content]\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-07-31T08:17:54.172Z\",\"interactionStatistic\":[{\"@type\":\"InteractionCounter\",\"interactionType\":\"https://schema.org/LikeAction\",\"userInteractionCount\":249},{\"@type\":\"InteractionCounter\",\"interactionType\":\"https://schema.org/CommentAction\",\"userInteractionCount\":9},{\"@type\":\"InteractionCounter\",\"interactionType\":\"https://schema.org/ShareAction\",\"userInteractionCount\":12}],\"commentCount\":9,\"isBasedOn\":\"https://bsky.app/profile/playboy.com/post/3mruilis5ks25\"},{\"@type\":\"DiscussionForumPosting\",\"url\":\"https://bsky.app/profile/annieknk.bsky.social/post/3mrpnthgr5k2g\",\"identifier\":\"at://did:plc:nqarhgmietntwhstejsi2lvl/app.bsky.feed.post/3mrpnthgr5k2g\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Annie Kelly\",\"alternateName\":\"@annieknk.bsky.social\",\"identifier\":\"did:plc:nqarhgmietntwhstejsi2lvl\",\"url\":\"https://bsky.app/profile/annieknk.bsky.social\"},\"text\":\"Possibly the most deeply confusing example of \\\"luxury beliefs\\\" I've ever seen. *Are* wealthy progressives pushing other parents to choose more risky, novel names?\",\"image\":[\"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:nqarhgmietntwhstejsi2lvl/bafkreienymatyn5nxerbrdpjwqgcdkjy276pu25fumz7gllm24ogjadw34\"],\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:nqarhgmietntwhstejsi2lvl/bafkreienymatyn5nxerbrdpjwqgcdkjy276pu25fumz7gllm24ogjadw34\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-07-28T14:49:46.466Z\",\"interactionStatistic\":[{\"@type\":\"InteractionCounter\",\"interactionType\":\"https://schema.org/LikeAction\",\"userInteractionCount\":40},{\"@type\":\"InteractionCounter\",\"interactionType\":\"https://schema.org/CommentAction\",\"userInteractionCount\":10},{\"@type\":\"InteractionCounter\",\"interactionType\":\"https://schema.org/ShareAction\",\"userInteractionCount\":1}],\"commentCount\":10},{\"@type\":\"DiscussionForumPosting\",\"url\":\"https://bsky.app/profile/annieknk.bsky.social/post/3mrpg75pqgc2s\",\"identifier\":\"at://did:plc:nqarhgmietntwhstejsi2lvl/app.bsky.feed.post/3mrpg75pqgc2s\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Annie Kelly\",\"alternateName\":\"@annieknk.bsky.social\",\"identifier\":\"did:plc:nqarhgmietntwhstejsi2lvl\",\"url\":\"https://bsky.app/profile/annieknk.bsky.social\"},\"text\":\"Definitely makes me respect Polanski more that he's been in trouble enough times over his posting that it's *definitely* been suggested to him that he hand over his socials to someone else, and clearly refused every time.\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-07-28T12:33:03.372Z\",\"interactionStatistic\":[{\"@type\":\"InteractionCounter\",\"interactionType\":\"https://schema.org/LikeAction\",\"userInteractionCount\":59},{\"@type\":\"InteractionCounter\",\"interactionType\":\"https://schema.org/CommentAction\",\"userInteractionCount\":1},{\"@type\":\"InteractionCounter\",\"interactionType\":\"https://schema.org/ShareAction\",\"userInteractionCount\":5}],\"commentCount\":1},{\"@type\":\"DiscussionForumPosting\",\"url\":\"https://bsky.app/profile/annieknk.bsky.social/post/3mreymsczos26\",\"identifier\":\"at://did:plc:nqarhgmietntwhstejsi2lvl/app.bsky.feed.post/3mreymsczos26\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Annie Kelly\",\"alternateName\":\"@annieknk.bsky.social\",\"identifier\":\"did:plc:nqarhgmietntwhstejsi2lvl\",\"url\":\"https://bsky.app/profile/annieknk.bsky.social\"},\"text\":\"My uncle told me a story about a particularly charismatic Catholic priest who ministered to Belfast dockworkers in the early 20C. Apparently 1 time he got them all so worked up that when he asked \\\"do you reject Satan and all his works?\\\" one of them yelled back \\\"yeah, fuck the devil he's a bastard!\\\"\\n\\n[contains quote post or other embedded content]\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-07-24T09:03:30.771Z\",\"interactionStatistic\":[{\"@type\":\"InteractionCounter\",\"interactionType\":\"https://schema.org/LikeAction\",\"userInteractionCount\":134},{\"@type\":\"InteractionCounter\",\"interactionType\":\"https://schema.org/CommentAction\",\"userInteractionCount\":4},{\"@type\":\"InteractionCounter\",\"interactionType\":\"https://schema.org/ShareAction\",\"userInteractionCount\":15}],\"commentCount\":4,\"isBasedOn\":\"https://bsky.app/profile/vituperativeerb.bsky.social/post/3mre6orgj5k2e\"},{\"@type\":\"DiscussionForumPosting\",\"url\":\"https://bsky.app/profile/annieknk.bsky.social/post/3mrdirmio7c2i\",\"identifier\":\"at://did:plc:nqarhgmietntwhstejsi2lvl/app.bsky.feed.post/3mrdirmio7c2i\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Annie Kelly\",\"alternateName\":\"@annieknk.bsky.social\",\"identifier\":\"did:plc:nqarhgmietntwhstejsi2lvl\",\"url\":\"https://bsky.app/profile/annieknk.bsky.social\"},\"text\":\"Isn't Jonny Depp in his 60s? When in Ebenezer's life *did* he turn into Scrooge exactly\\n\\n[contains quote post or other embedded content]\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-07-23T18:47:13.683Z\",\"interactionStatistic\":[{\"@type\":\"InteractionCounter\",\"interactionType\":\"https://schema.org/LikeAction\",\"userInteractionCount\":45},{\"@type\":\"InteractionCounter\",\"interactionType\":\"https://schema.org/CommentAction\",\"userInteractionCount\":7},{\"@type\":\"InteractionCounter\",\"interactionType\":\"https://schema.org/ShareAction\",\"userInteractionCount\":1}],\"commentCount\":7,\"isBasedOn\":\"https://bsky.app/profile/bloody-disgusting.com/post/3mrdabxv4sk2r\"},{\"@type\":\"DiscussionForumPosting\",\"url\":\"https://bsky.app/profile/annieknk.bsky.social/post/3mrcyrp2hl22j\",\"identifier\":\"at://did:plc:nqarhgmietntwhstejsi2lvl/app.bsky.feed.post/3mrcyrp2hl22j\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Annie Kelly\",\"alternateName\":\"@annieknk.bsky.social\",\"identifier\":\"did:plc:nqarhgmietntwhstejsi2lvl\",\"url\":\"https://bsky.app/profile/annieknk.bsky.social\"},\"text\":\"It's funny this has become a phenomenon because my complaint was that, if anything, the film is so unrelentingly *unsympathetic* towards Bear that sometimes I felt like I was being hit over the head with it!\\n\\n[contains quote post or other embedded content]\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-07-23T14:00:54.566Z\",\"interactionStatistic\":[{\"@type\":\"InteractionCounter\",\"interactionType\":\"https://schema.org/LikeAction\",\"userInteractionCount\":35},{\"@type\":\"InteractionCounter\",\"interactionType\":\"https://schema.org/CommentAction\",\"userInteractionCount\":3},{\"@type\":\"InteractionCounter\",\"interactionType\":\"https://schema.org/ShareAction\",\"userInteractionCount\":0}],\"commentCount\":3,\"isBasedOn\":\"https://bsky.app/profile/juliusgoat.bsky.social/post/3mrctq62juc2e\"},{\"@type\":\"DiscussionForumPosting\",\"url\":\"https://bsky.app/profile/annieknk.bsky.social/post/3mrcgkf5nqc2v\",\"identifier\":\"at://did:plc:nqarhgmietntwhstejsi2lvl/app.bsky.feed.post/3mrcgkf5nqc2v\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Annie Kelly\",\"alternateName\":\"@annieknk.bsky.social\",\"identifier\":\"did:plc:nqarhgmietntwhstejsi2lvl\",\"url\":\"https://bsky.app/profile/annieknk.bsky.social\"},\"text\":\"Sat there hunched over like \\\"omg Demetrius stop looking at me you're making it worseee\\\"\\n\\n[contains quote post or other embedded content]\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-07-23T08:34:41.366Z\",\"interactionStatistic\":[{\"@type\":\"InteractionCounter\",\"interactionType\":\"https://schema.org/LikeAction\",\"userInteractionCount\":44},{\"@type\":\"InteractionCounter\",\"interactionType\":\"https://schema.org/CommentAction\",\"userInteractionCount\":0},{\"@type\":\"InteractionCounter\",\"interactionType\":\"https://schema.org/ShareAction\",\"userInteractionCount\":2}],\"commentCount\":0,\"isBasedOn\":\"https://bsky.app/profile/mementomorty.bsky.social/post/3mrbldfeiqs2v\"},{\"@type\":\"DiscussionForumPosting\",\"url\":\"https://bsky.app/profile/annieknk.bsky.social/post/3mra2afhi522x\",\"identifier\":\"at://did:plc:nqarhgmietntwhstejsi2lvl/app.bsky.feed.post/3mra2afhi522x\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Annie Kelly\",\"alternateName\":\"@annieknk.bsky.social\",\"identifier\":\"did:plc:nqarhgmietntwhstejsi2lvl\",\"url\":\"https://bsky.app/profile/annieknk.bsky.social\"},\"text\":\"Great example of how making Twitter into a reactionary echo chamber has weirdly backfired on a lot of its users by making them more and more out of touch. Most people I know who went to see the Odyssey weren't even aware Nyong'o was in it. It was only the \\\"biggest talking point\\\" to racists on X\",\"image\":[\"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:nqarhgmietntwhstejsi2lvl/bafkreife5uk6ktnt4pohhzuo527h352phb2hlzer2rfq3iyyp4qr6a7bny\"],\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:nqarhgmietntwhstejsi2lvl/bafkreife5uk6ktnt4pohhzuo527h352phb2hlzer2rfq3iyyp4qr6a7bny\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-07-22T09:49:08.372Z\",\"interactionStatistic\":[{\"@type\":\"InteractionCounter\",\"interactionType\":\"https://schema.org/LikeAction\",\"userInteractionCount\":158},{\"@type\":\"InteractionCounter\",\"interactionType\":\"https://schema.org/CommentAction\",\"userInteractionCount\":10},{\"@type\":\"InteractionCounter\",\"interactionType\":\"https://schema.org/ShareAction\",\"userInteractionCount\":21}],\"commentCount\":10},{\"@type\":\"DiscussionForumPosting\",\"url\":\"https://bsky.app/profile/annieknk.bsky.social/post/3mqu2nktqn22t\",\"identifier\":\"at://did:plc:nqarhgmietntwhstejsi2lvl/app.bsky.feed.post/3mqu2nktqn22t\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Annie Kelly\",\"alternateName\":\"@annieknk.bsky.social\",\"identifier\":\"did:plc:nqarhgmietntwhstejsi2lvl\",\"url\":\"https://bsky.app/profile/annieknk.bsky.social\"},\"text\":\"I was SO painfully bored watching Iron Man 2 I decided then and there to begin a personal boycott of superhero movies, which had no particular effect since they dominated the box office for another 15 or so years. But I stayed strong!\\n\\n[contains quote post or other embedded content]\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-07-17T15:24:29.772Z\",\"interactionStatistic\":[{\"@type\":\"InteractionCounter\",\"interactionType\":\"https://schema.org/LikeAction\",\"userInteractionCount\":47},{\"@type\":\"InteractionCounter\",\"interactionType\":\"https://schema.org/CommentAction\",\"userInteractionCount\":5},{\"@type\":\"InteractionCounter\",\"interactionType\":\"https://schema.org/ShareAction\",\"userInteractionCount\":0}],\"commentCount\":5,\"isBasedOn\":\"https://bsky.app/profile/defector.com/post/3mqtxqh3k5b2q\"}]}</script>\n  \n</head>\n<body>\n  <div id=\"splash\">\n    <!-- Bluesky SVG -->\n    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 64 57\"><path fill=\"#006AFF\" d=\"M13.873 3.805C21.21 9.332 29.103 20.537 32 26.55v15.882c0-.338-.13.044-.41.867-1.512 4.456-7.418 21.847-20.923 7.944-7.111-7.32-3.819-14.64 9.125-16.85-7.405 1.264-15.73-.825-18.014-9.015C1.12 23.022 0 8.51 0 6.55 0-3.268 8.579-.182 13.873 3.805ZM50.127 3.805C42.79 9.332 34.897 20.537 32 26.55v15.882c0-.338.13.044.41.867 1.512 4.456 7.418 21.847 20.923 7.944 7.111-7.32 3.819-14.64-9.125-16.85 7.405 1.264 15.73-.825 18.014-9.015C62.88 23.022 64 8.51 64 6.55c0-9.818-8.578-6.732-13.873-2.745Z\"/></svg>\n  </div>\n  <div id=\"root\">\n  </div>\n\n  <noscript>\n    <h1 lang=\"en\">JavaScript Required</h1>\n    <p lang=\"en\">This is a heavily interactive web application, and JavaScript is required. Simple HTML interfaces are possible, but that is not what this is.\n    <p lang=\"en\">Learn more about Bluesky at <a href=\"https://bsky.social\">bsky.social</a> and <a href=\"https://atproto.com\">atproto.com</a>.\n    <div id=\"bsky_profile_summary\">\n  <h3>Profile</h3>\n  <p id=\"bsky_display_name\">Annie Kelly</p>\n  <p id=\"bsky_handle\">annieknk.bsky.social</p>\n  <p id=\"bsky_did\">did:plc:nqarhgmietntwhstejsi2lvl</p>\n  <p id=\"bsky_profile_description\">Researching antifeminism, conspiracy theories and the far right. PhD from UEA, former postdoc on Everything is Connected project. UK correspondent for QAA Podcast + MAN CLAN and writer of Vaccine: The Human Story. New series TRULY TRADLY DEEPLY out now!</p>\n</div>\n\n  </noscript>\n</body>\n</html>\n", "content_type": "text/html; charset=UTF-8"}}